ng", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 29, "stopped": true}, {"start": 22.281, "end": 22.463, "natural_end": 33.001, "dur": 0.183, "text": "Sim, na cidade! 🏙️  \nTufts é mais próxima da cidade, com muita vida acadêmica e proximidade com Boston.  \nA Northwestern, por outro lado, está em Chicago — grande, dinâm", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 29, "stopped": true}, {"start": 24.777, "end": 24.96, "natural_end": 38.857, "dur": 0.183, "text": "Boa noite! 😊 Tudo bem, fico feliz em conversar. Dorma bem e boa sorte na escolha! 🌙<|im_end|>", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 17, "stopped": true}, {"start": 28.699, "end": 36.459, "natural_end": 36.459, "dur": 7.76, "text": "Ah, Boston é incrível! 🏙️  \nMuito cultura, vida acadêmica, clima agradável e tudo perto — morar lá é como ter um bolo de chocolate no meio da cidade.", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 28, "stopped": false}, {"start": 36.459, "end": 36.459, "natural_end": 37.899, "dur": 0.0, "text": "De nada! 😊 Boa sorte na decisão — Boston é uma ótima escolha! 🌟<|im_end|>", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 14, "stopped": true}, {"start": 37.591, "end": 38.803, "natural_end": 49.031, "dur": 1.212, "text": "Ah, interessante!  \nSe você está pensando em Chester, talvez seja um bom ponto de referência — tem um bom equilíbrio entre vida acadêmica e ambiente mais tranquilo.  \nMas Boston ainda tem", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 31, "stopped": true}, {"start": 42.074, "end": 42.605, "natural_end": 53.114, "dur": 0.531, "text": "Entendeu! 😊  \nAtmosfera é o que importa — e às vezes, é o que mais define o \"sentimento\" de pertencer a uma escola.  \nSe Boston te faz sentir mais \"em", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 30, "stopped": true}, {"start": 53.126, "end": 61.526, "natural_end": 61.526, "dur": 8.4, "text": "Ah, entendi! 😊 Você tá falando de uma escola", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 9, "stopped": false}], "user_pieces": [{"kind": "partial", "text": "É,", "t_start": 1.71, "t_end": 2.35, "t_avail": 3.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "eu... eu...", "t_start": 2.59, "t_end": 3.03, "t_avail": 3.8000000000000003, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "amo muito.", "t_start": 2.99, "t_end": 3.31, "t_avail": 4.0, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 4.6000000000000005, "t_end": 4.6000000000000005, "t_avail": 4.6000000000000005, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "Eu sou uma pessoa muito indecisa,", "t_start": 4.4, "t_end": 6.3, "t_avail": 6.800000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 1}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "então não", "t_start": 6.48, "t_end": 6.8, "t_avail": 7.6000000000000005, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 1}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "consegui", "t_start": 6.8, "t_end": 7.16, "t_avail": 8.200000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 1}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "decidir tipo qual", "t_start": 7.16, "t_end": 8.24, "t_avail": 9.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 1}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "tipo de escola", "t_start": 8.24, "t_end": 8.96, "t_avail": 9.600000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 1}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "eu queria", "t_start": 8.96, "t_end": 9.5, "t_avail": 10.4, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 1}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "então eu me inscrevi na", "t_start": 9.5, "t_end": 10.58, "t_avail": 11.200000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 1}, {"kind": "final", "text": "Tufts e na Bu...", "t_start": 10.58, "t_end": 11.780000000000001, "t_avail": 11.8, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 1}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 12.4, "t_end": 12.4, "t_avail": 12.4, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "OU!", "t_start": 11.8, "t_end": 11.9, "t_avail": 12.600000000000001, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 2}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 13.200000000000001, "t_end": 13.200000000000001, "t_avail": 13.200000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 14.4, "t_end": 14.4, "t_avail": 14.4, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "E na Norte", "t_start": 13.000000000000002, "t_end": 13.920000000000002, "t_avail": 14.600000000000001, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 3}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "É", "t_start": 14.600000000000001, "t_end": 15.020000000000001, "t_avail": 16.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 4}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "bu e a norte,", "t_start": 15.000000000000002, "t_end": 15.740000000000002, "t_avail": 16.8, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 4}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "norte, as tendências são escolas tão diferentes", "t_start": 15.620000000000001, "t_end": 17.340000000000003, "t_avail": 18.8, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 4}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "e a", "t_start": 17.340000000000003, "t_end": 17.68, "t_avail": 18.8, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 4}, {"kind": "final", "text": "tuf tipo, tipo, em tamanho...", "t_start": 17.68, "t_end": 19.380000000000003, "t_avail": 19.400000000000002, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 4}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 21.0, "t_end": 21.0, "t_avail": 21.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "cidade na cidade.", "t_start": 19.400000000000002, "t_end": 20.42, "t_avail": 21.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 5}, {"kind": "final", "text": "na cidade.", "t_start": 19.98, "t_end": 20.46, "t_avail": 21.200000000000003, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 5}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "É", "t_start": 21.200000000000003, "t_end": 21.720000000000002, "t_avail": 22.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "final", "text": "estranho, mas eu...", "t_start": 21.860000000000003, "t_end": 22.78, "t_avail": 22.8, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 23.6, "t_end": 23.6, "t_avail": 23.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "Boa noite.", "t_start": 22.8, "t_end": 23.1, "t_avail": 23.8, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 7}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 24.400000000000002, "t_end": 24.400000000000002, "t_avail": 24.400000000000002, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "Porque tipo, morar em Boston seria", "t_start": 24.46, "t_end": 26.400000000000002, "t_avail": 27.200000000000003, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 8}, {"kind": "final", "text": "legal.", "t_start": 26.400000000000002, "t_end": 26.900000000000002, "t_avail": 27.6, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 8}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 28.200000000000003, "t_end": 28.200000000000003, "t_avail": 28.200000000000003, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "Obrigado!", "t_start": 27.6, "t_end": 27.62, "t_avail": 28.400000000000002, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 9}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 29.0, "t_end": 29.0, "t_avail": 29.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 29.6, "t_end": 29.6, "t_avail": 29.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 30.200000000000003, "t_end": 30.200000000000003, "t_avail": 30.200000000000003, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 30.8, "t_end": 30.8, "t_avail": 30.8, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 31.400000000000002, "t_end": 31.400000000000002, "t_avail": 31.400000000000002, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "Sim,", "t_start": 30.660000000000004, "t_end": 31.240000000000002, "t_avail": 32.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 10}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "eu me inscrevi", "t_start": 31.6, "t_end": 32.04, "t_avail": 32.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 10}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "na Norte", "t_start": 32.02, "t_end": 32.400000000000006, "t_avail": 33.2, "end